WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:02.490
Ayako-san...

00:05.770 --> 00:08.950
It sounds funny just to say it.

00:08.950 --> 00:13.140
Now that I’m dating someone, what should I do?

00:13.140 --> 00:14.840
Going to school together...

00:14.840 --> 00:16.220
Holding hands...

00:17.400 --> 00:20.000
N-Now I’m nervous!

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:52.500 --> 01:56.750
The beatrice index is rising in the Tokyo Bay area!

01:56.750 --> 02:00.010
The ionosphere has been annihilated
within a thirty-kilometer radius.

02:00.010 --> 02:02.440
Interference is visible in layers D, E, and F.

02:02.440 --> 02:04.260
Values are rising.

02:04.260 --> 02:07.260
Forty seconds until it reaches the Franklin coefficient.

02:10.270 --> 02:12.320
The index has frozen.

02:12.320 --> 02:15.050
It’s returning to normal levels.

02:15.050 --> 02:17.240
Begin disclosing this information
to the world’s nations.

02:17.240 --> 02:19.050
The value is slowly dropping.

02:19.050 --> 02:21.310
It’s returned to normal B-level values.

02:25.060 --> 02:28.770
The Student Council in the Prime of Youth

02:34.440 --> 02:36.700
<i>The power to create miracles...</i>

02:37.500 --> 02:40.350
<i>If I told you that, would you believe me?</i>

02:47.320 --> 02:48.390
Itsumi!

02:50.450 --> 02:52.400
What’s wrong, Itsumi?

02:56.020 --> 02:57.670
G-Good morning.

02:57.670 --> 02:58.900
Ayako-san.

02:58.900 --> 03:01.210
I came to get you.

03:01.210 --> 03:03.200
Kikukawa is waiting outside.

03:04.030 --> 03:05.160
Thanks...

03:08.270 --> 03:10.120
Mamoru, who’s that?

03:11.290 --> 03:12.870
Takasu Ayako-san.

03:12.870 --> 03:14.610
She’s my sempai at school...

03:14.610 --> 03:16.480
She’s more than just that!

03:16.480 --> 03:19.250
Um, well...

03:24.560 --> 03:27.390
Sh-She’s my girlfriend...

03:28.300 --> 03:34.330
<i>Girl!</i>

03:34.330 --> 03:37.170
Ayako-san, I’ll go change.

03:37.900 --> 03:41.840
Girl, girl, girl, girl, girl, girl!

03:49.260 --> 03:51.880
What the hell is this?!

03:50.680 --> 03:51.880
Congratulations
on becoming
a couple!
- The Student
Council

03:51.880 --> 03:53.580
The Boy the Witch Caught

03:52.430 --> 03:55.520
OK, 300 per shot!

03:55.960 --> 03:58.450
This one’s rare, so it’s 500 yen.

03:59.170 --> 04:00.790
Isn’t that a bit pricey?

04:00.790 --> 04:03.260
We’re in the same class. Gimme a discount.

04:03.260 --> 04:07.060
Being my classmate has nothing
to do with my business.

04:07.060 --> 04:08.830
Fujita Mitsuki!

04:09.360 --> 04:12.040
You’re selling pictures of Ayako-san
and Yoshimura Whosit?

04:12.040 --> 04:13.980
A sin that spits in the face of god!

04:13.980 --> 04:16.250
You deserve a thousand lashes

04:16.250 --> 04:19.710
and to be dragged around the city by cart!

04:19.710 --> 04:21.530
Then what about this?

04:25.250 --> 04:27.430
You insult me!

04:27.430 --> 04:29.560
Who’d want to become one

04:29.560 --> 04:31.540
with this shrimp, with the stupid hair?

04:31.540 --> 04:33.090
OK, say kimchee.

04:33.090 --> 04:35.500
Kimchee!

04:38.430 --> 04:39.900
Mitsuki!

04:39.900 --> 04:45.170
Who told you you could take pictures
of us and sell them?

04:46.920 --> 04:48.840
Good morning, everyone!

04:48.840 --> 04:50.990
This is your morning PA announcement.

04:50.990 --> 04:53.270
Right now, the biggest thing on everyone’s minds

04:53.270 --> 04:57.350
is Witch Beatrice and her relationship
with Yoshimura Mamoru-san.

04:57.350 --> 05:03.620
We have a recording of the definitive
moment for you, right here.

05:04.180 --> 05:07.200
Enjoy!

05:07.200 --> 05:08.760
Thump, thump, thump, thump, thump...

05:08.760 --> 05:13.230
<i>If you’re with me, you may be put in danger again.</i>

05:13.690 --> 05:14.960
<i>But I...</i>

05:14.960 --> 05:16.290
Wh-When did they...

05:18.170 --> 05:22.310
That crazy-headed woman!

05:25.340 --> 05:27.480
Ayako-san!

05:29.890 --> 05:31.010
Grin.

05:34.390 --> 05:37.090
You really did start dating Ayako-san?

05:37.090 --> 05:39.120
You must hate life.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.580
I think you’re a hero.

05:40.580 --> 05:41.670
Someone!

05:41.670 --> 05:44.820
The beast has escaped from her cage!

05:44.820 --> 05:48.070
But we will continue this broadcast to the end!

05:48.850 --> 05:50.620
Sh-She’s right in front of me!

05:50.620 --> 05:52.240
The beast is right in front of me!

05:52.240 --> 05:53.240
Someo—

06:09.640 --> 06:10.390
<i>Huh?</i>

06:10.390 --> 06:11.890
<i>This scent...</i>

06:16.270 --> 06:17.830
I-I’m sorry.

06:19.650 --> 06:21.100
I must’ve scared you.

06:21.100 --> 06:24.990
But if they saw you with me, they’d harass us again.

06:24.990 --> 06:26.500
No, it’s OK.

06:26.500 --> 06:29.710
Um... I recognized your gentle perfume.

06:30.330 --> 06:32.930
Anyway, what’s up?

06:32.930 --> 06:35.360
Um, well...

06:36.540 --> 06:38.190
Wow!

06:38.190 --> 06:40.020
It’s all of my favorites!

06:40.020 --> 06:42.360
Thanks!

06:43.740 --> 06:44.860
This is great!

06:44.860 --> 06:46.570
I’m so glad...

06:47.600 --> 06:50.360
How about an onigiri, too?

06:50.360 --> 06:51.930
Sure!

06:53.100 --> 06:55.260
This is good, too.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.740
I’m glad.

07:08.650 --> 07:10.240
Come on...

07:10.240 --> 07:13.570
The new couple enjoys a hand-made meal on the roof.

07:14.120 --> 07:17.830
I bet next, she’ll be knitting him a sweater.

07:21.110 --> 07:22.220
Brother?

07:22.220 --> 07:23.230
No.

07:23.230 --> 07:29.100
It’s all so stereotypical, it’s hard to care.

07:29.100 --> 07:33.840
You’re right. Ayako’s already done the “Aah” thing.

07:33.840 --> 07:37.850
Personally, I’m hoping she feeds him
with her mouth or something.

07:40.070 --> 07:41.980
That’s too much!

07:42.360 --> 07:45.150
This is our cue.

07:48.090 --> 07:50.420
Topic: A Welcome Party for Mamoru-kun

07:48.330 --> 07:50.420
My welcome party?

07:50.420 --> 07:51.290
Yes.

07:51.770 --> 07:55.480
Everything got messed up due to the Astral Fire matter.

07:55.480 --> 07:57.340
Ayako, what do you think?

07:57.340 --> 07:59.370
Yeah, it’s a good idea.

07:59.370 --> 08:01.000
All right!

08:01.000 --> 08:06.140
Everyone, we all meet at Ayako-san’s
house this weekend, OK?

08:06.140 --> 08:07.890
W-Wait a second.

08:07.890 --> 08:09.670
Why my house?

08:09.670 --> 08:11.580
It’s completely natural

08:11.580 --> 08:14.330
for students to play at each other’s houses,

08:14.330 --> 08:15.300
Ayako.

08:15.300 --> 08:16.390
That’s right, that’s right!

08:16.830 --> 08:17.850
Even so...

08:19.020 --> 08:22.250
Application

08:19.430 --> 08:22.230
I’ve submitted the documents
to the relevant parties.

08:22.230 --> 08:24.660
Ha Ha Ha Ha
Ha Ha Ha Ha

08:27.380 --> 08:28.590
Documents?

08:29.500 --> 08:30.730
It’s decided.

08:30.730 --> 08:33.700
Then we’re done for the day.

08:33.700 --> 08:34.860
Dismissed!

08:35.450 --> 08:38.240
Mamoru, the bath’s ready.

08:40.280 --> 08:42.710
I can’t believe you’re wandering about,
dressed that way again...

08:44.830 --> 08:45.940
Excite you?

08:45.940 --> 08:47.110
No way.

08:47.110 --> 08:49.750
You’ll get a cold. Put on some PJs.

08:49.750 --> 08:50.850
Right, right.

08:55.340 --> 08:56.600
Hey...

08:56.600 --> 08:57.850
What?

08:57.850 --> 09:00.610
Who is Ayako-san?

09:00.610 --> 09:04.580
She must be pretty rich.
She picked you up in a luxury car!

09:04.580 --> 09:06.270
What’s her family like?

09:06.270 --> 09:08.430
She has pretty big boobs...

09:08.430 --> 09:10.130
What are her three sizes?

09:10.130 --> 09:13.260
I know. I can look at a horoscope
to see if you’re compatible!

09:13.260 --> 09:14.840
What are her blood type and sign?

09:16.620 --> 09:17.780
I don’t know.

09:17.780 --> 09:18.710
What?

09:18.710 --> 09:20.270
Why not?

09:20.270 --> 09:23.230
She’s your girlfriend.

09:23.230 --> 09:27.280
But we just started dating...

09:27.280 --> 09:29.730
You don’t ask her questions about that stuff?

09:29.730 --> 09:33.160
That’s like not having any interest in her.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.750
That’s not what I...

09:34.750 --> 09:37.360
You told her you like her, right?

09:44.220 --> 09:47.610
I don’t think I did.

09:50.930 --> 09:52.610
I can’t believe you!

09:56.740 --> 10:00.020
<i>I want to know more about her, too.</i>

10:00.020 --> 10:01.020
<i>But...</i>

10:05.790 --> 10:07.590
This is hard...

10:10.840 --> 10:13.550
This is Ayako-san’s house?

10:15.690 --> 10:16.520
Yes.

10:16.520 --> 10:18.250
Hello there.

10:18.250 --> 10:19.440
Yoshimura-sama.

10:19.440 --> 10:20.260
Welcome.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.450
Come in.

10:26.450 --> 10:28.180
OK, thanks.

10:30.670 --> 10:32.470
This house is amazing.

10:33.590 --> 10:36.860
Even I don’t know what’s in all the rooms.

10:36.860 --> 10:40.960
Um... Is the rest of the family away?

10:40.960 --> 10:44.090
Oh, you didn’t know?

10:44.090 --> 10:47.800
Ayako-sama lives alone in this mansion.

10:48.430 --> 10:49.460
Alone?

10:49.460 --> 10:50.500
Yes.

10:50.500 --> 10:54.910
The house is owned by Takasu Naoyuki, her grandfather.

10:57.810 --> 11:00.020
I’ve heard that name.

11:00.020 --> 11:02.490
He’s a former prime minister.

11:06.530 --> 11:09.790
He may be a king in the world of politics,

11:09.790 --> 11:11.640
but he spoils his niece rotten.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.020
I had no idea...

11:14.020 --> 11:17.810
But I’d believe anything about her.

11:18.360 --> 11:21.650
So where are her parents?

11:22.670 --> 11:23.530
Well...

11:28.840 --> 11:31.040
Oh hi, Mamoru-kun, welcome.

11:31.750 --> 11:34.920
Look... Ayako’s...

11:37.590 --> 11:40.140
Ayako-san, what’s wrong?

11:48.270 --> 11:51.530
We managed to finish it alive.

11:51.530 --> 11:55.030
Jeez, we’re just trying to help.

11:55.030 --> 11:57.350
I told you I didn’t want your help!

11:57.350 --> 12:01.500
But you said I had to dress formally
for Mamoru’s welcome party...

12:01.500 --> 12:04.070
It looks really good.

12:04.070 --> 12:06.310
It’s wonderful, really.

12:07.890 --> 12:11.080
Now, then... Everyone’s here.

12:11.080 --> 12:13.120
Let’s get ready.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.800
Let us begin!

12:15.800 --> 12:17.940
Welcome to the Student Council!

12:17.940 --> 12:19.960
To celebrate your arrival, we’re having...

12:20.370 --> 12:22.940
a hide-and-seek tournament!

12:33.840 --> 12:35.650
Let’s begin.

12:35.650 --> 12:37.490
Are there any questions?

12:37.490 --> 12:39.750
Too many, actually.

12:39.750 --> 12:41.950
Hide-and-seek in someone’s house,
not even asking?

12:41.950 --> 12:44.380
Listen, we’ll just kinda play along.

12:44.380 --> 12:44.980
OK.

12:44.980 --> 12:49.590
Oh, I forgot. This hide-and-seek
has a punishment if you lose.

12:49.590 --> 12:50.790
A punishment?

12:50.790 --> 12:53.270
If we find you within an hour,

12:53.270 --> 12:57.070
on Monday, you have to kiss before
the entire student body.

12:57.070 --> 12:58.000
All right!

12:59.630 --> 13:01.370
Let’s get started!

13:01.370 --> 13:03.470
One...

13:03.470 --> 13:04.800
Two...

13:04.800 --> 13:07.070
Three...

13:04.800 --> 13:07.300
Wait, you guys!

13:07.070 --> 13:08.360
Four...

13:07.300 --> 13:10.310
Ayako-san, let’s run.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.310
Right.

13:15.840 --> 13:18.030
Jeez, this is nuts.

13:18.030 --> 13:21.550
Either way, we’re not losing.

13:24.220 --> 13:26.430
A secret door?

13:26.430 --> 13:28.730
It leads to another building.

13:28.730 --> 13:32.690
This house has all kinds of things to foil intruders.

13:32.690 --> 13:35.240
But then it isn’t hide-and seek.

13:35.240 --> 13:37.740
It’s better than the punishment, right?

13:37.740 --> 13:41.270
Who cares about the hide-and-seek?

13:42.110 --> 13:44.330
We’ve got a strong ally here.

13:44.330 --> 13:47.040
One who knows the whole layout of the mansion.

13:47.040 --> 13:52.680
How long has it been since she
played hide-and-seek with her family?

13:50.140 --> 13:52.680
Takasu Household Hide-And-Seek
Tournament Operation HQ

13:53.220 --> 13:55.770
Now, how far can you run?

13:57.050 --> 13:59.850
Let’s have some tea while we wait.

13:59.850 --> 14:00.940
OK.

14:00.940 --> 14:03.330
But this is amazing.

14:03.330 --> 14:05.330
All the furniture is gorgeous.

14:05.330 --> 14:07.660
It’s like they’re alive...

14:11.820 --> 14:13.140
I found you.

14:14.810 --> 14:16.240
You didn’t find us.

14:17.440 --> 14:19.910
You didn’t find us!

14:24.980 --> 14:26.180
OK, say cheese.

14:26.180 --> 14:28.820
Why was Shione in the other building?

14:28.820 --> 14:31.260
How’d they find the secret door?

14:35.930 --> 14:37.520
What’s up?

14:38.930 --> 14:40.400
You haven’t found us!

14:40.400 --> 14:42.630
You haven’t found us yet!

14:40.660 --> 14:41.890
Ayako-san...

14:43.000 --> 14:45.060
You haven’t found us yet!

14:48.330 --> 14:49.170
Why?

14:49.170 --> 14:51.000
We found you!

14:55.710 --> 14:57.550
No, you didn’t.

14:59.790 --> 15:01.340
Say cheese!

15:02.420 --> 15:04.680
They haven’t found us yet!

15:06.560 --> 15:08.090
OK, smile!

15:08.760 --> 15:11.760
We’ll keep running for the rest of the hour!

15:11.760 --> 15:16.870
Um, I don’t think I remember
playing hide-and-seek like this...

15:16.870 --> 15:18.640
Who cares?

15:18.640 --> 15:21.640
I’m not taking that punishment!

15:21.640 --> 15:26.440
My first kiss is going to be romantic,
by the sea at sunset...

15:26.440 --> 15:27.780
I’ve already decided that!

15:28.610 --> 15:31.280
I-It’s nothing.

15:35.120 --> 15:38.490
We’re back!

15:39.560 --> 15:41.830
So you’re back, zombies!

15:41.830 --> 15:45.130
We found you!

15:48.120 --> 15:49.720
Let’s go, Mamoru.

15:49.720 --> 15:50.930
Let us down!

15:53.930 --> 15:55.680
Say cheese!

15:56.820 --> 15:58.480
Playtime is over.

15:58.480 --> 16:00.380
We’ll return to the original mission.

16:03.620 --> 16:04.900
This is bad!

16:04.900 --> 16:06.420
They’re coming from behind, too!

16:08.620 --> 16:11.250
All right, then. If they’ve got us trapped,

16:11.250 --> 16:13.670
I’ll blow them apart...

16:13.670 --> 16:16.610
Let’s hide for real, Ayako-san!

16:16.610 --> 16:18.240
Let’s go in here.

16:21.790 --> 16:22.770
Not there...

16:28.440 --> 16:30.450
Is this...

16:31.260 --> 16:32.840
My room...

16:32.840 --> 16:36.740
I’m sorry for entering without asking!

16:36.740 --> 16:38.850
I saw them go in there!

16:39.280 --> 16:40.360
Over here!

16:49.170 --> 16:51.130
A-Ayako-san...

16:51.130 --> 16:52.690
Ayako, where are you?

16:55.900 --> 16:57.300
No.

16:57.300 --> 16:59.730
I guess she’s not here.

16:59.730 --> 17:01.630
That’s impossible.

17:01.630 --> 17:02.910
Search harder.

17:03.640 --> 17:06.930
But I don’t see her.

17:05.060 --> 17:08.810
<i>A sweet scent, but not perfume. What is it?</i>

17:09.980 --> 17:12.510
<i>Ayako-san’s gentle scent...</i>

17:15.180 --> 17:17.860
Let’s look somewhere else.

17:17.860 --> 17:19.240
No, wait.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.870
There’s still the closet.

17:20.870 --> 17:22.600
Eh, they wouldn’t be in there.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.530
Then let’s look somewhere else.

17:24.530 --> 17:28.650
Let’s do that! Let’s do that!

17:28.650 --> 17:30.150
They’re gone.

17:30.150 --> 17:31.200
Yes...

17:35.250 --> 17:37.660
Let’s get out of here.

17:40.140 --> 17:42.010
So cute!

17:42.550 --> 17:44.710
This is you, isn’t it?

17:45.500 --> 17:46.760
Can I see it?

17:46.760 --> 17:48.750
Wait, Mamoru—

17:49.870 --> 17:50.790
Don’t!

17:51.140 --> 17:53.290
Ayako-san...

17:56.630 --> 17:58.860
Are those people...

18:00.460 --> 18:04.560
Those are my parents.

18:07.300 --> 18:10.110
The only people in my family who can control beatrice

18:10.110 --> 18:11.990
are my uncle and me.

18:11.990 --> 18:16.210
My mom and dad were jealous of my power.

18:18.660 --> 18:21.890
And they called me a monster.

18:25.140 --> 18:28.880
Looking back, I think it couldn’t be helped.

18:28.880 --> 18:32.710
When I was little, I couldn’t control my abilities.

18:48.780 --> 18:49.980
That’s awful...

18:51.130 --> 18:52.780
That’s just awful!

18:53.710 --> 18:55.410
It’s nothing.

18:57.990 --> 18:59.970
I’m used to it.

18:59.970 --> 19:04.310
People being jealous, hating me, being unfriendly...

19:04.310 --> 19:04.920
I’m used to—

19:04.920 --> 19:06.470
You shouldn’t be!

19:07.080 --> 19:10.510
Everyone likes you.

19:10.510 --> 19:11.640
The President

19:11.640 --> 19:13.400
and Shione-san,

19:13.400 --> 19:15.050
and Yagi-san and Youko-san,

19:15.050 --> 19:17.510
and Anna-san and Yuuka-san and Mitsuki,

19:17.510 --> 19:18.380
and everyone!

19:18.380 --> 19:19.780
Wait, what are you...

19:19.780 --> 19:21.110
And me, too!

19:21.110 --> 19:24.350
I... I like you.

19:29.150 --> 19:34.120
Um, well... I don’t mean...

19:35.080 --> 19:37.190
You don’t?

19:37.190 --> 19:40.160
I do... But...

19:40.700 --> 19:41.700
But?

19:48.640 --> 19:50.610
I don’t want you to be used to it...

19:51.400 --> 19:54.850
People being jealous, hating you, being unfriendly...

19:55.430 --> 19:57.780
I don’t want you to be used to that.

19:57.780 --> 20:00.970
I don’t want you to say things like that.

20:06.290 --> 20:07.690
Thank you.

20:09.090 --> 20:11.050
Thank you, Mamoru.

20:20.800 --> 20:21.780
Mitsuki...

20:22.750 --> 20:24.650
You’re right!

20:24.650 --> 20:28.710
I’ve been hidden here the whole time,
ever since you entered.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.550
You didn’t notice?

20:30.550 --> 20:32.790
That was great, that was great.

20:32.790 --> 20:35.420
That was great.

20:36.990 --> 20:38.590
You guys...

20:38.590 --> 20:39.980
Hey.

20:39.980 --> 20:43.890
You guys seemed a bit too anxious.
We were worried.

20:44.950 --> 20:46.760
Then this hide-and-seek was...

20:46.760 --> 20:49.420
You’re overthinking things.

20:49.420 --> 20:51.580
Hide-and-seek is hide-and-seek.

20:51.580 --> 20:52.020
And...

20:52.020 --> 20:54.840
The punishment’s the punishment.

20:54.840 --> 20:56.710
If we tag you...

20:56.710 --> 20:59.440
You kiss in front of the whole student body!

20:59.440 --> 21:02.250
I’m looking forward to tomorrow.

21:02.250 --> 21:05.180
Looking forward to it!

21:05.180 --> 21:07.230
N-No way...

21:11.000 --> 21:12.940
Don’t worry, Mamoru.

21:12.940 --> 21:15.940
They haven’t found us yet.

21:18.040 --> 21:21.060
You haven’t, have you?

21:21.800 --> 21:22.520
Again?

21:22.520 --> 21:25.710
Wait... Miss!

21:29.410 --> 21:31.070
Once more for the end!

21:32.010 --> 21:33.350
Say cheese!

21:40.860 --> 21:41.780
Jeez!

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.520 --> 23:16.810
I saw it.

23:16.810 --> 23:21.270
Keep it a secret, but Mamoru-kun and Ayako-san...

23:21.270 --> 23:27.070
At the school fair, they k-k-k-k-k-k-kissed... Hyaah!

23:27.070 --> 23:30.240
By the way, do you ever confuse the kanji

23:30.240 --> 23:32.210
for “prince” and “egg”?

23:33.270 --> 23:37.490
Now I want rice with egg...

23:37.490 --> 23:39.740
I’m hungry.

23:39.740 --> 23:43.310
Next time: My Prince.

23:39.920 --> 23:43.980
My Prince
